### List students
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/students
Accept: application/json


### Create student
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/students
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "bishal",
  "email": "dhital@example.com",
  "phone": "9800000000",
  "address": "Lalitpur",
  "date_of_birth": "2004-05-15"
}

### Show student
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/students/
Accept: application/json

### Update student
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/students/6
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated bishal",
  "email": "updated1@gmail.com",
  "phone": "9811111111",
  "address": "Bhaktapur",
  "date_of_birth": "2004-05-15"
}